        <title type="html"><![CDATA[docs(html): add img controls attribute]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45930</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45930"/>
        <updated>2026-09-29T22:41:49.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185269030?u=1fc22565ccf4566b6f734fabaa87e03d9a31cfe4&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Adds the missing <code class="notranslate">controls</code> attribute to the <code class="notranslate">&lt;img&gt;</code> element documentation and describes the browser-provided interactive controls.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>HTML Standard: <a href="https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#attr-img-controls" rel="nofollow">https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#attr-img-controls</a></li>
<li>WHATWG PR: <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3924343435" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/12151" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/whatwg/html/pull/12151/hovercard" href="https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/12151">whatwg/html#12151</a></li>
<li>The example uses a fullscreen control rather than controls for animated-image playback, as requested in the issue.</li>
<li>Compatibility data is being added separately in <code class="notranslate">mdn/browser-compat-data</code> (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5638053677" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30705" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30705/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30705">mdn/browser-compat-data#30705</a>).</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #43730.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4237813633" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43730" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/43730/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43730">#43730</a></p>]]></content>
